  "description": "这是操作SQL SERVER简单的增删改查库。\n1. 自动建库，建表，建字段，省去建表精力。\n2. 支持对象，Json数据保存，实现像NOSQL一样的复杂数据增删改查。\n详细使用请见包自述文件\nThis is a simple addition, deletion and modification library for operating SqLite.\n1. Automatic library building, table building, field building, save the energy of table building.\n2. Support object, Json data storage, as complex as NOSQL\nSee the package readme for detailed usage",
